			## Donkey.bas Turns 45 – And It's Still More Honest Than Your Entire Tech Stack 😏

			Back in my day, we didn't have 'content' and 'engagement'...  We had a donkey.  And a car.  And 131 lines of BASIC that could run on a machine with less RAM than your browser uses just to show a cookie banner.  😂

			Now everyone is clapping because some old game is old.  Big deal.  I was writing FORTRAN on punch cards when that thing was a twinkle in Bill Gates's eye.  And you know what?  Donkey.bas has more in common with real engineering than the garbage you kids ship today.  It didn't need a package manager, a container, or a team of twelve to render one car and one donkey.  It just ran.  😤

